# wagmi CLI output: `packages/abis/src/generated.ts` is DELIBERATELY COMMITTED (Phase 4). The indexer, the
# dApp and the keeper consume it as ordinary TypeScript, so a checkout with no Foundry toolchain still
# typechecks, builds and tests. Regenerate with `pnpm --filter @amplestocks/abis generate`.

